--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 12da250283eb4d21bd2b828afb3b8a8d, type: 3}
  m_Name: KillBossQuestStartDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _dialogueId: KillBossQuestStartDialogue
  _dialogueData:
  - lineId: 1
    dialogueLine: "The spider matrons are dead. But something still feels wrong.
      The earth\u2026 it trembles."
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 2
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 2
    dialogueLine: "Because the corruption hasn\u2019t lost its root. What you killed\u2026
      were merely branches. Something stronger, twisted, guided their growth."
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 3
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 3
    dialogueLine: You know who it is?
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 4
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 4
    dialogueLine: "A warlock. Servant of an ancient master beyond the shadows. He
      didn\u2019t enter this forest through strength - but through weakness. The
      weakness of men who sought power without understanding its cost. He created
      the spiders. He poisoned the springs that feed our world."
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 5
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 5
    dialogueLine: Where can I find him?
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 6
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 6
    dialogueLine: In the west. Where the trees fall silent, even in daylight. The
      ground there is black, like his soul. But beware. He is no ordinary foe. He
      is an echo of calamities that once nearly destroyed the world.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 7
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 7
    dialogueLine: "If I don\u2019t stop him\u2026 will it happen again?"
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Next
      nextLineId: 8
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3b263900f7c870a498421a2b6acdaf27, type: 3}
  - lineId: 8
    dialogueLine: "Yes. And this time, we won\u2019t be able to heal. But I see you\u2019ve
      changed. The spark has become a flame. You are ready."
    answerOption:
    - answerText: I will find him. And end this darkness.
      nextLineId: 9
      triggerComplete: 1
    - answerText: Okay, but I need more training.
      nextLineId: 10
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 9
    dialogueLine: And may the forest remember your name.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Close
      nextLineId: 
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  - lineId: 10
    dialogueLine: Just come on, we don't have much time.
    answerOption:
    - answerText: Close
      nextLineId: 
      triggerComplete: 0
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 44036bdd3dc83864ca75d54ecd843074, type: 3}
  _alternativeDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b58f9e57861ff1d419fc0f5dd51070c8, type: 2}
